etaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0423c01","n":"0423c","t":"第七地中由種種法無差別義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0424a01","n":"0424a","t":"地差別謂為安住如其所得法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0424b01","n":"0424b","t":"應無退轉故於諸大乘契經等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0424c01","n":"0424c","t":"大無邊惑智二障言覆隱者隔"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0425a01","n":"0425a","t":"治諸散動定毘鉢舍那者謂能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0425b01","n":"0425b","t":"論曰由增勝故說十地中別修"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0425c01","n":"0425c","t":"世到彼岸緣亦為饒益諸有情"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0426a01","n":"0426a","t":"釋曰有五補特伽羅經三無數"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0426b01","n":"0426b","t":"者謂如彼尸羅波羅蜜多品中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0426c01","n":"0426c","t":"益安樂有情不發自他貪等煩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0427a01","n":"0427a","t":"苦故無有罪能助道故生無量"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0427b01","n":"0427b","t":"亦應有異故為此問六種差別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0427c01","n":"0427c","t":"無念樂者施以念樂為召他方"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0428a01","n":"0428a","t":"特伽羅一切法性皆無所有甚"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0428b01","n":"0428b","t":"遮言是不樂義於來求施當施"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0428c01","n":"0428c","t":"何能邪見若一切處遍行邪性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0429a01","n":"0429a","t":"論曰甚深佛法者云何名為甚"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0429b01","n":"0429b","t":"說殺害於父母等密意言詞十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0429c01","n":"0429c","t":"計度故離此五相應知是名無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0430a01","n":"0430a","t":"是無分別智非思義種類釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0430b01","n":"0430b","t":"是無分別智彼所知無相釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1598_p0430c01","n":"0430c","t":"釋曰後所得諸行